{"slug":"models","title":"Models and models.yaml","group":"Reference","blurb":"Every model in the study and every config field.","blocks":[{"t":"p","html":"Every model is one entry in <code>slmjury/configs/models.yaml</code>, under a key you pass to the runners. The tables below are read from that file."},{"t":"h2","text":"Sections","id":"sections"},{"t":"table","head":["Section","Entries","What it holds"],"align":["","r",""],"rows":[["<code>student_models</code>","8","Students: the models whose answers the judges grade."],["<code>reference_models</code>","2","MT-Bench reference scorers, served through the Together API."],["<code>judge_models</code>","16","Small judges (0.6B to 14B)."],["<code>large_judge_models</code>","7","Large judges (70B to 122B) and the Qwen3-32B ladder judge."],["<code>datasets</code>","10","Dataset keys the loaders accept."],["<code>token_settings</code>","2","The two budgets: the quick and the reasoned verdict."],["<code>open_ended_settings</code>","3","Settings shared by the open-ended scoring runs."],["<code>ensemble_judges</code>","5","The judges and budgets the juries draw from."]]},{"t":"h2","text":"Fields","id":"fields"},{"t":"table","head":["Field","What it does","Example","Used in"],"align":["","","",""],"rows":[["<code>model</code>","Hugging Face repository of the weights, or the API model name for a reference scorer.","<code>Qwen/Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct-GPTQ-Int8</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>judge_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>, <code>reference_models</code>"],["<code>tensor_parallel_size</code>","GPUs the model is split across. Also sets the GPU count in the cost estimate.","<code>2</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>judge_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>gpu_memory_utilization</code>","Share of each GPU's memory vLLM may use.","<code>0.85</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>judge_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>quantization</code>","Quantisation scheme of the checkpoint, passed to vLLM.","<code>gptq</code>","<code>student_models</code>"],["<code>max_model_len</code>","Longest prompt plus output, in tokens.","<code>32768</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>judge_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>dtype</code>","Weight and activation type passed to vLLM.","<code>bfloat16</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>always_thinks</code>","The model always reasons first, so it runs at 8,192 tokens only.","<code>True</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>judge_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>trust_remote_code</code>","Allows model code from the Hugging Face repository.","<code>True</code>","<code>student_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>max_num_seqs</code>","Sequences vLLM decodes at once. Lower it if a run runs out of memory.","<code>64</code>","<code>judge_models</code>"],["<code>enable_thinking</code>","Turns the model's thinking mode on at the reasoned budget.","<code>True</code>","<code>judge_models</code>, <code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>params_b</code>","Parameter count in billions, used for the size axis and the cost estimate.","<code>70</code>","<code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>active_params_b</code>","Active parameters per token, for mixture-of-experts models.","<code>12</code>","<code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>ladder</code>","Marks the Qwen3-32B ladder judge, listed apart from the small and large judges.","<code>True</code>","<code>large_judge_models</code>"],["<code>provider</code>","API provider of a reference scorer.","<code>together</code>","<code>reference_models</code>"],["<code>api_key_env</code>","Environment variable that holds the API key.","<code>TOGETHER_API_KEY</code>","<code>reference_models</code>"],["<code>temperature</code>","Sampling temperature of a reference scorer.","<code>0</code>","<code>reference_models</code>"],["<code>m